// The package itself. A package or a module can be reopened in any file of
// the workspace (R9): every file below reopens `package ds { ... }` and adds
// one entity to it. The identity is the qualified name, not the file.
// A class, a requirement, a sequence or a diagram cannot be reopened: declaring
// the same identity twice anywhere in the workspace is an error (R5).

package ds {
  owner: dcoello
  title: diagnostics package
}
